    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear players, monsters do not spawn automatically. Use the \u2018C\u2019 key to switch to the overhead view and press the start button to spawn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player, third-person 3D tower defense game that blends shooting, racing, optical illusions, and traditional strategy gameplay. Build defense towers to fend off enemies or press \u2018C\u2019 to switch perspectives and join the battle directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the \u2018C\u2019 key to freely switch between interfaces, then in overhead mode, press the start button to enjoy a thrilling experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keypad 1, 2, 3 to quickly select defense towers, and W, A, S, D to move. Both the character perspective and overhead perspective allow movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/extras/3f64ca6d124309c4633afdc2a2a25419.avif?t=1751905014\" width=690 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear players, monsters do not spawn automatically. Use the \u2018C\u2019 key to switch to the overhead view and press the start button to spawn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player, third-person 3D tower defense game that blends shooting, racing, optical illusions, and traditional strategy gameplay. Build defense towers to fend off enemies or press \u2018C\u2019 to switch perspectives and join the battle directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the \u2018C\u2019 key to freely switch between interfaces, then in overhead mode, press the start button to enjoy a thrilling experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keypad 1, 2, 3 to quickly select defense towers, and W, A, S, D to move. Both the character perspective and overhead perspective allow movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/extras/3f64ca6d124309c4633afdc2a2a25419.avif?t=1751905014\" width=690 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "This is not a regular tower defense game. It has third-person shooting, standard tower defense, and racing. It is fun and interesting. The most important thing is that the characters move on the 3D surface, and the attacking monsters move on the visual dislocation surface. It is worth a try.",
